    {
      "math_academy_id": "q-181303",
      "knowledge_point_id": "e2aee319-68d6-54f7-8023-b24d32610bc4",
      "knowledge_point": "Sketching Cartesian Products of Special Sets in the Coordinate Plane",
      "problem": "Which of the following is a representation of the set $S=R\\times N$ in the Cartesian plane?",
      "worked_solution": "The Cartesian product $A\\times B$ consists of all ordered pairs whose first coordinate belongs to $A$ and whose second coordinate belongs to $B.$\n\n$$\nA\\times B=\\{(a,b)\\,:\\,a\\in A,\\,b\\in B\\}\n$$\n\nIn this case, the set \n\n$$\nS=R\\times N\n$$\n\n \ncontains every point in ${R}^{2}$ whose $x$-coordinate is a real number and whose $y$-coordinate is a natural number.\n\n$$\nS=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,x\\in R,\\,y\\in N\\}\n$$\n\nTo visualize $S,$ consider ${S}_{1}⊂S$ containing all points whose $x$-coordinate is any real number and whose $y$-coordinate equals $1.$\n\n$$\n{S}_{1}=\\{(x,1)\\,:\\,x\\in R\\}\n$$\n\nWe can represent ${S}_{1}$ in the plane as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082768/assets/f8808e4c35775c754dab0bf328a8d129e423009e18ec5f4b962461eba2afcea2.png)\n\nNext, consider ${S}_{2}⊂S$ containing all points whose $x$-coordinate is any real number and whose $y$-coordinate equals $2.$\n\n$$\n{S}_{2}=\\{(x,2)\\,:\\,x\\in R\\}.\n$$\n\nWe can represent ${S}_{2}$ in the plane as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082768/assets/a51fe9dc5bf7c55b01f72a45d4b88bde4653f0d3da85c1231b0d54c76a6e8c81.png)\n\nWe can create the subsets ${S}_{3},{S}_{4},{S}_{5},…$ similarly. Our Cartesian product consists of the *union* of these subsets:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}R\\times N & ={S}_{1}\\cup {S}_{2}\\cup {S}_{3}\\cup … \\\\  & ={⋃}_{i\\in N}{S}_{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can visualize $R\\times N$ as the set of horizontal lines shown in the diagram below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082768/assets/7ae3c488e60d3dcda304649e575a7d2efc54be7262a54d0455550af420c39b68.png)",
